# project: api-v1-deprecation

=== announce ===
Announce the deprecation of public API v1 with a 12-month sunset date.
Done when the announcement is published and the sunset clock is running.
* [Announcement published, sunset clock started] -> wave_small

=== wave_small ===
Migrate the small-customer wave: notify the cohort, provide migration tooling, chase stragglers.
Done when small-cohort v1 traffic is under 1% of baseline.
+ [Small-cohort traffic under 1% of baseline] -> wave_medium
+ [Stragglers remain, keep chasing] ~loop~ -> wave_small
+ [Wave stalled, human decides whether to proceed] @human -> wave_medium

=== wave_medium ===
Migrate the medium-customer wave: notify the cohort, provide migration tooling, chase stragglers.
Done when medium-cohort v1 traffic is under 1% of baseline.
+ [Medium-cohort traffic under 1% of baseline] -> wave_enterprise
+ [Stragglers remain, keep chasing] ~loop~ -> wave_medium
+ [Wave stalled, human decides whether to proceed] @human -> wave_enterprise

=== wave_enterprise ===
Migrate the enterprise wave: notify the cohort, provide migration tooling, chase stragglers.
Each enterprise may request one extension; done when enterprise v1 traffic is under 1% of baseline.
+ [Enterprise-cohort traffic under 1% of baseline] -> brownouts
+ [An enterprise requests its one extension] -> extension_review
+ [Stragglers remain, keep chasing] ~loop~ -> wave_enterprise
+ [Wave stalled, human decides whether to proceed] @human -> brownouts

=== extension_review ===
The VP of Product personally reviews an enterprise extension request (one per customer).
+ [VP approves the extension] @human ~loop~ -> wave_enterprise
+ [VP denies the extension] @human ~loop~ -> wave_enterprise

=== brownouts ===
Run scheduled brownouts of API v1 for one month to flush out remaining traffic.
* [Brownout month complete] -> legal_check

=== legal_check ===
Legal reviews contracts to confirm no contractual commitments block the shutoff date.
+ [Legal confirms shutoff is clear] @human -> hard_shutoff
+ [Legal finds a contractual blocker] @human -> handle_blocker

=== handle_blocker ===
Extend the shutoff for the blocked customer and keep their access alive while the blocker stands.
Re-check with legal monthly until the blocker clears.
+ [Monthly re-check with legal] ~loop~ -> legal_check

=== hard_shutoff ===
Flip the switch: hard shutoff of API v1 for all remaining traffic, then decommission.
-> END
